    "Family Portal link: here. If you have already created an account with SSS, log into the Family Portal as a Returning Family.",
    "USTA National Campus will be available for selection once you complete your Annual Settings (Partner code: 201156), SSS completes setup and sends you a confirmation of opening. Families will not be able to apply until your Annual Settings are complete.",
    "USTA National Campus will be available for selection once you complete your Annual Settings (Partner code: 201156), SSS completes setup and sends you a confirmation of opening. Families will not be able to apply until your Annual Settings are complete.",
    "Once your Family Portal account is created, you must complete the PFS.",
    "Once your Family Portal account is created, you must complete the PFS.",
    "Once all PFS sections are completed, the “Submit & Pay” button will activate. Follow the prompts to the payment screen and pay a $60 non-refundable fee. If you are awarded a scholarship, the non-refundable fee will be added to your scholarship total.",
    "Once all PFS sections are completed, the “Submit & Pay” button will activate. Follow the prompts to the payment screen and pay a $60 non-refundable fee. If you are awarded a scholarship, the non-refundable fee will be added to your scholarship total.",
    "Once your PFS is submitted, it cannot be withdrawn from the system. Applications can be edited through the portal after submission.",
